    "CLASS_VERIFIER_CONTRACT.md s6.4 (exit 1: stage-1 artifact validity failed)"
   ],
   "description": "primary artifact is schema-valid and its signature is well-formed, but a hashed member was mutated after sealing, so integrity.current does not recompute",
   "expected_exit": 1,
   "expected_results_file": false,
   "files": [
    "bindings.json",
    "independence.json",
    "request.json",
    "revocation.json"
